mit you know we don't have  enough evidence to rule out  foreign technology we don't have enough  proof to rule out that it could be some  kind of sort of secret american  technology  uh from special access program but they  asked  they asked a whole long list of agencies  hey are these yours  and the answer was no uh so it's it's a  real shift for the pentagon to put out  even this limited report that says  this is a legitimate mystery it is a  national security matter  it is a concern for aerospace safety  so we should look into it it just stirs  up more questions  you know and is is it at a point now  where  there are no answers left is this all  the  the military has to give no  not not by a long shot there was a  report that was given to congress  behind closed doors a classified version  of this report  that's nine times larger we know from  some of the stories that we've leaked  the leaks that we've had in the stories  we've produced that they have visual  evidence that they have  visual images video shot by their navy  viper teams on these ships  that indicate these are some kind of  craft of the one the uss omaha now there  are three different videos released from  that  first you have the thermal image of the  sphere this big  six foot in diameter at least spear that  followed right along this u.s navy  warship  um for more than an hour there were and  then there's radar images that shows  there were as many as 14 of these things  that surrounded the ship at that same  time in fact  in a broader sense in that same time  period three days  in july of 2019 there were more than a  hundred of these objects that appeared  around nine u.s navy warships they don't  know what they are  it is a legitimate mystery that deserves  to be investigated  i i think that you probably could uh  identify some of these things if you put  some  money and resources into it the uap task  force that produced this report  um they had two staff members two  part-time staff members  